{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSPredicate","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the style layer’s predicate to include only the features in the source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer that satisfy a condition that you define. If the style layer initially","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes from the style, its predicate corresponds to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"filter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property in the style JSON.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the “","type":"text"},{"text":"Predicates and Expressions","type":"text"},{"text":"”","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guide for details about the predicate syntax supported by this class.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","level":3,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To filter the layer to include only the features whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"index","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute is 5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or 10 and whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"ele","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute is at least 1,500, you could create an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSCompoundPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" along these lines:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let layer = MLNLineStyleLayer(identifier: \"contour\", source: terrain)","layer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"contours\"","layer.predicate = NSPredicate(format: \"(index == 5 || index == 10) && CAST(ele, 'NSNumber') >=","1500.0\") mapView.style?.addLayer(layer)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The style layer’s predicate."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"predicate","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNVectorStyleLayer(py)predicate","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectorstylelayer\/predicate"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorStyleLayer":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectorstylelayer","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"text":" is an abstract superclass for style layers whose content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is defined by an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"text":" object.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNVectorStyleLayer","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNVectorStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"